msgid "Discussion"
msgstr "Discussion"

msgid "At all temperatures, including room temperature, all liquids undergo evaporation. Nevertheless, the evaporation of liquids with higher boiling points occurs at a significantly slower pace and may not be readily observable. Conversely, liquids with lower boiling points experience rapid evaporation."
msgstr "At all temperatures, including room temperature, all liquids undergo evaporation. Nevertheless, the evaporation of liquids with higher boiling points occurs at a significantly slower pace and may not be readily observable. Conversely, liquids with lower boiling points experience rapid evaporation."

msgid "Next"
msgstr "Next"

msgid "Spirit is a volatile liquid and has a lower boiling point when compared to water. Hence, spirit evaporates faster than water at room temperature."
msgstr "Spirit is a volatile liquid and has a lower boiling point when compared to water. Hence, spirit evaporates faster than water at room temperature."

msgid "The liquid phase changes to gaseous phase, as water evaporates on heating. The molecules move and vibrate so quickly that they escape into the atmosphere as molecules of water vapour."
msgstr "The liquid phase changes to gaseous phase, as water evaporates on heating. The molecules move and vibrate so quickly that they escape into the atmosphere as molecules of water vapour."

msgid "infe_1"
msgstr "The liquid phase changes to gaseous phase, as water evaporates on heating.<br>The molecules move and vibrate so quickly that they escape into the<br>atmosphere as molecules of water vapour."

msgid "infe_2"
msgstr "Spirit is a volatile liquid and has a lower boiling point<br>when compared to water. Hence, spirit evaporates<br>faster than water at room temperature."

msgid "Process of Evaporation"
msgstr "Process of Evaporation"